[00:13.26]We love Jehovah with heart, mind, and soul;
[00:22.32]But since we are sinful, we need self-control.
[00:32.46]Fleshly desires bring trouble and strife;
[00:42.64]Living by spirit brings peace and life.
[01:05.90]Satan’s temptations confront us each day,
[01:13.66]And sin’s law within us can lead us astray.
[01:24.96]Power of truth is greater than sin.
[01:34.68]Thanks to Jehovah, our minds can win.
[01:56.04]Each word and action reflects on God’s name,
[02:04.54]So we must endeavor to keep free from blame.
[02:15.64]In all we do, we make this our goal:
[02:25.40]Always maintaining our self-control.
